{
  "about": "Synthetic Serbian dictation for the STT prototype (TRELLO-131, spec 027 Q1). Each item is read aloud once and saved as <id>.m4a (or .wav) outside the repository. `text` is the reference transcript; `expect` is what the voice agent should end with after this utterance, applied in order to an empty draft (items 16 and 17 each start from an empty draft: a whole recipe told in one go). Units use the canonical AI unit vocabulary (lib/ai/ai_units.dart).",
